SUMMARY:😂🎭 FREE COMEDY EVENT – TROUPES SKETCH SHOWCASE! 🎭😂
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n😂
 🎭 FREE COMEDY NIGHT – TROUPES SKETCH SHOWCASE! 🎭😂\n\nLooking fo
 r some laughs on a Saturday afternoon?\nJoin us for the **Troupes Sketch S
 howcase** at Comedy Bar! Nick managed to score us some **FREE tickets**\, 
 so let's enjoy an evening of live comedy together.\n\n📍 Meet: 4:45 PM\n
 🎭 Show Time: 5:00 PM\n🎟️ Cost: FREE (courtesy of Nick!)\n⚠️ Sp
 ots are very limited\, so please RSVP only if you're certain you can atten
 d. If your plans change\, update your RSVP as soon as possible so someone 
 else can take your spot.\n\nAbout the Show:\nThe Troupes Sketch Showcase f
 eatures original comedy created and performed by some of Toronto's most ta
 lented up-and-coming sketch comedians. Expect a fast-paced mix of clever w
 riting\, memorable characters\, absurd situations\, and plenty of laughs. 
 Comedy Bar's troupe programs are known for developing some of the city's s
 trongest comedy talent and showcasing fresh new voices in sketch comedy. (
 [Comedy Bar](https://comedybar.ca/troupes?utm_source=chatgpt.com "TROUPES 
 | Comedy Bar"))\n\nEvent Details:\n[https://comedybar.ca/shows/troupes-ske
 tch-showcase](https://comedybar.ca/shows/troupes-sketch-showcase)\n\nWheth
 er you're a longtime comedy fan or just looking for something fun and diff
 erent to do on a Saturday\, this should be a great afternoon out.\n\nLook 
 for Nick when you arrive. Registered attendees will have his contact infor
 mation if needed.\nSee you there! 😄
