SUMMARY:🐾 Presto Discount! Explore the Toronto Zoo with Nick! 🐾
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n**🐾 
 Meetup Event: Explore the Toronto Zoo with Nick! 🐾**\n\nJoin us for an 
 unforgettable day at the world-famous [Toronto Zoo](https://www.torontozoo
 .com/plan) on **Saturday\, June 27**!\n\nHome to over 5\,000 animals from 
 around the globe\, the Toronto Zoo is one of the largest zoos in the world
 —and what makes it truly unique is its **geographic layout**. Instead of
  grouping animals by species\, the zoo is divided into regions like the Af
 rican Savanna\, Indo-Malaya\, and the beloved **Canadian Domain**\, where 
 animals roam in habitats that closely mirror their natural environments. I
 t’s immersive\, educational\, and a ton of fun to explore.\n\n***\n\n**
 📍 Meetup Details**\n\n* **Time:** 10:00 AM\n* **Location:** Inside the 
 zoo\, just past the admission gates\n* **Look for:** Nick with the Meetup 
 sign\n* All registered attendees will have Nick’s phone number in case y
 ou need help finding the group\n\n***\n\n**🚶‍♂️ What to Expect**\
 nThis is a **walking-heavy event**\, so come prepared! One highlight (and 
 workout!) is the **long hill down into the Canadian Domain**—totally wor
 th it\, but definitely wear your best walking shoes.\nNick has been visiti
 ng the zoo since childhood and loves sharing its magic with others. Whethe
 r it's your first visit or your fiftieth\, you’ll see it through fresh e
 yes.\n\n***\n\n**🥪 Food Plans**\nFeel free to **bring a lunch** or purc
 hase food onsite—we’ll stop to eat together at one of the zoo’s rest
 aurants.\n\n***\n\n**🌦️ Rain or Shine**\nThe event runs regardless of
  weather\, so **dress accordingly**.\n\n***\n\n**⏰ Wrap-Up**\nWe’ll li
 kely wrap up around **3:30 PM**\, but you’re always free to leave whenev
 er you like.\n\n***\n\n**🎟️ Bonus Tip**\nIf you have a PRESTO card\, 
 you can get **15% off admission**—don’t forget to bring it!\nCheck the
  deal here: [https://prestocard.ca/en/perks-offers/perks](https://prestoca
 rd.ca/en/perks-offers/perks)\n\n***\n\n**🙌 Drop-Ins Welcome**\nNot sure
  of your schedule? No problem—feel free to just show up!\n\n***\n\nCome 
 out for a day of animals\, nature\, and great company. See you at the zoo!
  🐒🐘🦒
